      "id": 1,
      "title": "About this app",
      "type": "text",
      "datasource": null,
      "description": "About this app. Back to the main dashboard: https://grafana.npty.online/d/logs-at-a-glance",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Friendly Actual Budget** - the voice-budget API on Vercel (voice-budget.npty.online), shipping logs to K12 via OTLP since 2026-11-10. No Gatus endpoint (Vercel app, not k8s). Back to [Logs at a glance](https://grafana.npty.online/d/logs-at-a-glance).\n\n**Logging:** receipts are flowing now. 4 lines in the last 24h, 9 in 7d (checked 2026-11-13): wallet-ingest-queued 2 + transaction-confirmed 2 in 24h (real receipts on 13 Nov 08:49 and 09:24 Dubai, each confirmed ~6s after queueing), 4 + 4 in 7d. The heartbeat line was a one-off deploy check (1 line in 7d, 0 in 24h). The receipt lines carry no amount or merchant yet, just \"<action> completed\" - enriching them needs a code change in friendly-actual-budget."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.2.3"
    },
